{
  "name": "rockdesk-mcp",
  "version": "1.0.18",
  "description": "MCP server for AI agents to control your other computers by a 9-digit RockDesk ID: shell, files, screenshots, mouse and keyboard on Windows, macOS, Linux and Android. Works with Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, DeepSeek Harness, Cursor and Trae. Peer to peer, no public IP or port forwarding. 让 AI 按 ID 远程控制另一台电脑。",
